      "member": "ocaml-8eb41f72ded84df884c3671734c947f612091f84/runtime/caml/mlvalues.h",
      "path": "docs/evidence/retained-why-formatter-prefix-repair-20261019/ocaml-source.tar.gz",
      "text": "   of functions (for finalization, comparison, hashing, etc)\n   followed by raw data.  The contents of custom blocks is not traced by\n   the GC; therefore, they must not contain any [value].\n   See [custom.h] for operations on method suites. */\n#define Custom_tag 255\n#define Data_custom_val(v) ((void *) &Field((v), 1))\nstruct custom_operations;       /* defined in [custom.h] */"
    },
